 "description": "The Stormpjäs Försöksmodell/43-44 is a Swedish self-propelled artillery vehicle. Scania-Vabis developed the project from November 1943 to August 1944. Its main feature was its rear-mounted superstructure and the 150 mm fsthaub m/02 gun inside it. Only one prototype was built, and it never saw combat. The Spj fm/43-44 was introduced in Update 1.97 \"Viking Fury\" . This SPG has enormous firepower at close and medium ranges but has a long reload time and limited ammunition.",
